--------------------------------
InferenceMode (推理模式管理)
来源: c10/core/InferenceMode.h, c10/core/InferenceMode.cpp
--------------------------------

【状态】
    prev_mode: AutogradState              # 保存的前一个自动微分状态
    prev_keyset: LocalDispatchKeySet      # 保存的前一个调度键集合

【接口】
    InferenceMode(enabled: bool = true)
        用途: 构造推理模式守卫，设置TLS状态
        调用: AutogradState::get_tls_state(), AutogradState::set_tls_state(),
              c10::impl::tls_local_dispatch_key_set(),
              c10::impl::_force_tls_local_dispatch_key_set()
        
        逻辑:
            # 保存当前状态
            prev_mode = AutogradState::get_tls_state()
            prev_keyset = c10::impl::tls_local_dispatch_key_set()
            
            # 设置新的自动微分状态
            # 启用推理模式 = 禁用梯度模式
            AutogradState::set_tls_state(AutogradState(
                grad_mode = !enabled,
                inference_mode = enabled,
                fw_grad_mode = !enabled,
                multithreading_enabled = !enabled
            ))
            
            # 更新调度键集合
            if enabled:
                included = prev_keyset.included_.remove(DispatchKey::ADInplaceOrView)
                excluded = prev_keyset.excluded_ | c10::autograd_dispatch_keyset
            else:
                included = prev_keyset.included_.add(DispatchKey::ADInplaceOrView)
                excluded = prev_keyset.excluded_ - c10::autograd_dispatch_keyset
            
            cur_keyset.set_included(included)
            cur_keyset.set_excluded(excluded)
            c10::impl::_force_tls_local_dispatch_key_set(cur_keyset)

    ~InferenceMode()
        用途: 析构时恢复之前的TLS状态
        调用: AutogradState::set_tls_state(),
              c10::impl::_force_tls_local_dispatch_key_set()
        
        逻辑:
            AutogradState::set_tls_state(prev_mode)
            c10::impl::_force_tls_local_dispatch_key_set(prev_keyset)

    is_enabled() -> bool
        用途: 查询当前是否处于推理模式
        调用: AutogradState::get_tls_state()
        
        逻辑:
            return AutogradState::get_tls_state().get_inference_mode()

【依赖】
    AutogradState                                    # 自动微分状态管理
    c10::impl::tls_local_dispatch_key_set           # TLS调度键集合访问
    c10::impl::_force_tls_local_dispatch_key_set    # TLS调度键集合设置
    c10::autograd_dispatch_keyset                   # 自动微分相关的调度键集合
    DispatchKey::ADInplaceOrView                    # 原地/视图操作的调度键

【备注】
    - RAII守卫，线程局部生效
    - 不可拷贝、不可移动
    - 推理模式下的TLS状态约束:
      * ADInplaceOrView 不在 included 集合中
      * Autograd 在 excluded 集合中
      * GradMode 被禁用
    - 正常模式下的TLS状态约束:
      * ADInplaceOrView 在 included 集合中
      * Autograd 不在 excluded 集合中
      * GradMode 默认启用
    - 设置推理模式会同步设置梯度模式，但反之不成立
    - 性能优化: is_enabled() 使用独立的TLS标志，避免检查完整的DispatchKeySet
